        "raw": "<p>Several forumites are in the game, so I came up with some challenge modes specifically for their cards.</p><p>Hope you enjoy, and if you are in the game let me know and I&#39;ll get you one.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rabit: &nbsp;Look at the Bones!!!</p><p>Imprisoned Rogue treats all non-inmate, non-character targets as if they had the keyword agent. &nbsp;If there are no targets to destroy, Imprisoned Rogue treats all Heroes as if they had the keyword Agent. &nbsp;</p><p>Arenson: &nbsp;Police protection.</p><p>The Informant is indestructible while The Deputy is in play.</p><p>Or:</p><p>Not on my watch!</p><p>The deputy gains the following text:</p><blockquote><p>Redirect damage dealt to The Broker to the Crooked Cops with the highest HP.</p></blockquote><p>Ronway: &nbsp;Heroes must die!</p><p>Cursed Acolyte gains the following text:</p><blockquote><p>Increase damage dealt to hero targets by 1. &nbsp;If this card would be dealt damage redirect it to the Zombie with the lowest HP.</p></blockquote><p>If Cursed Acolyte reduces a Hero Character Card to 0 or fewer hp, Ronway wins.</p><p>Pydro: &nbsp;[REDACTED]</p><p>Whenever Seige breaker damages a hero target, increase the next damage dealt to that target by 2.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Hope you enjoy!</p><p>Anyone else?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
